*.bat

# ── Internal working files — never part of the public repository ──────────────
# Session hand-offs, agent/tooling scratch, commit-message drafts and local QA
# output. None of this is needed to build, run or maintain the game, and it has
# no business being public. Nothing already tracked is affected by these rules.
.agents/
.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
_*_msg.txt
# Same drafts under the other name they were saved as (_cm36 … _cm50). Every one of them has
# already been consumed by git commit -F: _cm50.txt's first line is the subject of a428f4b.
_cm*.txt
CHANGES_SINCE_*.md
qa_reports/
tools/qa/_to_delete/
# The repo-root parking folder. The Cowork bridge cannot delete files, so anything being thrown
# away is moved here and removed locally instead. Note: comments must be on their OWN line —
# git has no inline comment syntax, so "pattern  # why" is a literal pattern that matches nothing.
/_to_delete/

# Public Pages artifact, assembled by tools/build-public-site.js - never committed.
_site/
